1
00:01:51,500 --> 00:01:53,750
'Thanks to all Magazines, Television,
Websites, FM Radio and all media people'

2
00:02:05,799 --> 00:02:07,382
Hi! Hello! Welcome back to our show!

3
00:02:07,416 --> 00:02:08,416
Your favourite tunes.

4
00:02:08,458 --> 00:02:09,374
With yours truly, Kathir.

5
00:02:09,416 --> 00:02:12,499
We closed yesterday's show
with a very important question.

6
00:02:13,929 --> 00:02:15,512
"Who is known as the
Indian Michael Jackson?"

7
00:02:15,537 --> 00:02:18,662
Are you eager to know who is the
contestant who got the right answer?

8
00:02:20,656 --> 00:02:21,697
What's up dude?

9
00:02:24,513 --> 00:02:25,763
What's the deal?

10
00:02:28,374 --> 00:02:29,535
Came through?

11
00:02:39,328 --> 00:02:40,829
Flopped?

12
00:02:42,112 --> 00:02:42,988
Bro!

13
00:02:44,364 --> 00:02:45,989
Amazing news.

14
00:02:48,064 --> 00:02:50,814
Aren't we also on the same boat?

15
00:02:51,364 --> 00:02:52,113
Right?

16
00:02:57,814 --> 00:02:59,773
If you try to venture out alone,

17
00:03:01,495 --> 00:03:02,245
Huh?

18
00:03:02,822 --> 00:03:04,572
(Laughs mockingly)

19
00:03:05,833 --> 00:03:08,458
(Popular Tamil song 'Apdi Podu' playing)

20
00:03:08,791 --> 00:03:09,791
Sathish?

21
00:03:11,917 --> 00:03:12,917
Sathish?!

22
00:03:20,750 --> 00:03:21,708
Hey!

23
00:03:22,374 --> 00:03:23,875
Sathish?!!!

24
00:03:27,750 --> 00:03:31,958
(Groans in pain)

25
00:04:33,500 --> 00:04:34,648
Greetings everyone!

26
00:04:34,673 --> 00:04:36,172
We all are there for you

27
00:04:36,197 --> 00:04:38,739
and to help you with problems
related to your mental well-being.

28
00:04:40,122 --> 00:04:41,706
That's why all this
has been arranged

29
00:04:41,731 --> 00:04:44,189
And this "World Mental Health Day"
is to remind you of it

30
00:04:44,713 --> 00:04:47,683
You need to examine
and ask yourselves,

31
00:04:47,708 --> 00:04:49,291
"Why the desire to
get into public service?"

32
00:04:49,333 --> 00:04:50,754
When you introspect,

33
00:04:50,779 --> 00:04:53,445
you will gain an understanding
of the society around you.

34
00:04:54,308 --> 00:04:57,124
The position you are going to
acquire, is not one of authority

35
00:04:57,372 --> 00:04:58,830
but one of great responsibility.

36
00:04:59,360 --> 00:05:00,914
When faced with this responsibility,

37
00:05:00,939 --> 00:05:04,146
you will understand social
equilibrium and its implications.

38
00:05:04,555 --> 00:05:05,930
When you do,

39
00:05:05,955 --> 00:05:08,204
you may experience an
unfathomable feeling of fear.

40
00:05:08,229 --> 00:05:10,354
That fear can deeply impact you.

41
00:05:10,499 --> 00:05:13,063
That fear can push you
into doing many things,

42
00:05:13,088 --> 00:05:15,088
It can also prevent you
from doing some things.

43
00:05:15,274 --> 00:05:17,315
All you need to do in that moment is,

44
00:05:17,340 --> 00:05:19,048
gather all your courage and

45
00:05:19,096 --> 00:05:20,429
face your fear without
a second thought.

46
00:05:23,254 --> 00:05:25,337
Sir is not an easy person
to meet with,

47
00:05:25,362 --> 00:05:27,029
we've brought him here
with great difficulty.

48
00:05:27,082 --> 00:05:29,416
So please ask whatever
questions you may have.

49
00:05:29,458 --> 00:05:30,416
(Chuckles) Nothing like that sir!

50
00:05:30,458 --> 00:05:32,041
You can approach me anytime.

51
00:05:32,124 --> 00:05:33,208
Thank you sir.

52
00:05:34,986 --> 00:05:35,652
Manoj!

53
00:05:35,696 --> 00:05:37,237
Ask whatever is on your mind.

54
00:05:37,805 --> 00:05:38,763
Get up!

55
00:05:41,333 --> 00:05:42,249
Hi Sir,

56
00:05:42,833 --> 00:05:44,416
you are a big inspiration for me.

57
00:05:45,431 --> 00:05:48,181
Since we discussed about
fear a lot today,

58
00:05:48,208 --> 00:05:49,499
I have this question.

59
00:05:50,081 --> 00:05:51,665
Once you became a police officer,

60
00:05:51,690 --> 00:05:54,232
have you ever been afraid of
something or someone?

61
00:05:54,555 --> 00:05:56,637
Could you share about
any such experience sir?

62
00:06:03,541 --> 00:06:04,833
Of course!

63
00:06:11,749 --> 00:06:14,207
'Introducing
Ajay Karthi'

64
00:06:14,708 --> 00:06:16,374
'K. Bhagyaraj'

65
00:06:17,791 --> 00:06:19,750
'Natarajan Subramaniam'

66
00:06:20,697 --> 00:06:22,405
'Introducing
Anjana Murugan'

67
00:07:10,917 --> 00:07:14,458
(Singing a popular Tamil song)

68
00:08:10,958 --> 00:08:11,833
Sir?

69
00:08:13,537 --> 00:08:14,662
Sir?!

70
00:08:16,005 --> 00:08:16,922
Sir!!!

71
00:08:20,716 --> 00:08:21,507
Sir?!

72
00:08:30,704 --> 00:08:32,161
Someone please help!

73
00:08:32,333 --> 00:08:33,666
Here.. there are two..

74
00:08:36,208 --> 00:08:37,875
Why are there so many
police officers near that house?

75
00:08:37,917 --> 00:08:39,583
It seems someone else was
killed in that house.

76
00:08:39,666 --> 00:08:41,458
At this point, we don't know
how many people were killed

77
00:08:41,499 --> 00:08:42,708
Hey!
Scram!

78
00:08:43,625 --> 00:08:44,666
Good morning, sir!

79
00:08:47,812 --> 00:08:49,808
The body has been removed right,
why is there a crowd here?

80
00:08:49,833 --> 00:08:51,296
Sir... actually no, we are
still waiting for the ambulance.

81
00:08:51,321 --> 00:08:53,280
Over the phone, you said
the ambulance was here

82
00:08:53,305 --> 00:08:54,597
No sir, it is on the way

83
00:08:54,622 --> 00:08:56,330
- When will it get here?
- Any moment now, sir

84
00:08:57,431 --> 00:08:58,640
Disperse this crowd first

85
00:08:58,870 --> 00:09:00,578
Ravi, please get these
people out of here

86
00:09:06,333 --> 00:09:06,917
Sir

87
00:09:07,134 --> 00:09:08,009
How are you man?

88
00:09:08,034 --> 00:09:09,368
Super, everything going good

89
00:09:09,625 --> 00:09:10,875
Is everything wrapped up here?

90
00:09:10,917 --> 00:09:12,333
As if, we are still waiting
for the ambulance.

91
00:09:12,374 --> 00:09:13,374
We'll be done in 30 minutes.

92
00:09:13,898 --> 00:09:15,506
He was such a gentleman,

93
00:09:15,531 --> 00:09:18,406
the whole town talks about
how this house is cursed.

94
00:09:18,964 --> 00:09:20,505
Used to wonder why,

95
00:09:20,958 --> 00:09:22,124
but now this has happened.

96
00:09:23,124 --> 00:09:24,833
Whenever I ran into him,
I used to tell him

97
00:09:24,875 --> 00:09:26,833
"Get a ritualistic cleaning
done for the house."

98
00:09:27,039 --> 00:09:28,414
But this happened before
he could get to that.

99
00:09:29,208 --> 00:09:30,708
The boy also died right?

100
00:09:32,041 --> 00:09:33,374
Alright, forget that!

101
00:09:33,722 --> 00:09:35,347
Move my transfer order first,

102
00:09:35,416 --> 00:09:36,666
it's very difficult here.

103
00:09:36,708 --> 00:09:38,853
Chithra has been complaining
ever since we shifted to the city.

104
00:09:38,878 --> 00:09:39,921
Please see to it!

105
00:09:39,946 --> 00:09:41,680
Things are not how
they used to be,

106
00:09:41,705 --> 00:09:43,372
I'm trying to get it through.

107
00:09:44,041 --> 00:09:45,875
Even the top brass is being strict.

108
00:09:46,124 --> 00:09:47,166
That aside,

109
00:09:47,333 --> 00:09:48,917
Why don't you come home
with Chithra sometime?

110
00:09:48,958 --> 00:09:50,124
First you handle this,

111
00:09:50,166 --> 00:09:51,124
- then I'll come over with my whole family
- Okay.

112
00:09:51,166 --> 00:09:52,333
Shall I get back to my work now?

113
00:09:52,374 --> 00:09:54,166
- Alright! I'll see you!
- Alright! Okay.

114
00:09:56,082 --> 00:09:57,166
Move them away!

115
00:09:57,208 --> 00:09:58,458
Get these people out of here first!

116
00:09:58,583 --> 00:09:59,625
Move, move out!

117
00:10:00,541 --> 00:10:02,499
Sir, what exactly happened?

118
00:10:36,791 --> 00:10:37,917
Did you get photographs of all this?

119
00:10:37,958 --> 00:10:38,708
Yes, taken sir.

120
00:10:39,833 --> 00:10:40,833
Where is the other corpse?

121
00:10:41,333 --> 00:10:42,499
Sir, it's in the other room.

122
00:10:43,666 --> 00:10:44,708
Sir, here...

123
00:10:46,958 --> 00:10:47,708
Sir.

124
00:10:59,958 --> 00:11:01,082
Hand me a pen!

125
00:11:29,458 --> 00:11:30,917
When you take notes, write down
that there were only 5 cigarettes.

126
00:11:30,958 --> 00:11:31,917
Okay sir.

127
00:12:15,625 --> 00:12:17,541
You there!
Will the ambulance get here or not?

128
00:12:17,625 --> 00:12:19,291
Sir... Just... 2 Minutes, Sir...

129
00:12:19,333 --> 00:12:20,333
It's almost here.

130
00:12:31,881 --> 00:12:32,839
Hello,

131
00:12:33,355 --> 00:12:34,730
this is the assistant
commissioner speaking!

132
00:12:34,755 --> 00:12:36,338
When was the call placed
for an ambulance?

133
00:12:40,948 --> 00:12:42,197
Oh, alright, will call back!

134
00:12:45,096 --> 00:12:46,346
Full of lies?

135
00:12:47,499 --> 00:12:48,374
Just leave!

136
00:12:50,522 --> 00:12:51,564
I said, leave!

137
00:12:59,875 --> 00:13:01,208
(Sudden gasp)

138
00:13:38,333 --> 00:13:39,333
Balachander!

139
00:13:39,625 --> 00:13:40,791
Get out of here!

140
00:14:21,750 --> 00:14:27,208
'DARK'

141
00:14:58,082 --> 00:14:58,833
Sir?

142
00:14:58,875 --> 00:14:59,666
Sir?

143
00:15:00,416 --> 00:15:01,333
The doctor is here.

144
00:15:05,124 --> 00:15:05,833
Sorry doctor.

145
00:15:05,875 --> 00:15:06,999
The older gentleman
suffered a heart attack.

146
00:15:07,041 --> 00:15:08,708
Time of death is
approximately 8 hours ago.

147
00:15:08,750 --> 00:15:10,166
The young man is unconscious,

148
00:15:10,208 --> 00:15:11,499
I'll let you know once
he gains consciousness.

149
00:15:11,541 --> 00:15:13,458
What are the chances
of his survival madam?

150
00:15:13,666 --> 00:15:14,708
Unlikely.

151
00:15:14,750 --> 00:15:15,917
We'll try our best.

152
00:15:40,390 --> 00:15:43,025
(Sobs uncontrollably)

153
00:15:52,338 --> 00:15:54,421
He's been disturbed for
quite some time sir.

154
00:15:55,404 --> 00:15:57,864
I tried asking him many times.

155
00:15:59,003 --> 00:16:02,330
He always avoided my questions
saying it's work-related stress.

156
00:16:02,753 --> 00:16:04,294
He's a really nice guy, sir.

157
00:16:06,211 --> 00:16:08,086
He doesn't know anyone here,

158
00:16:10,086 --> 00:16:11,336
except me.

159
00:16:12,628 --> 00:16:14,086
Has he ever spoken about me?

160
00:16:16,378 --> 00:16:17,127
Sir?

161
00:16:17,253 --> 00:16:19,419
Has he ever mentioned
the name 'Balachander'?

162
00:16:20,461 --> 00:16:21,336
No sir.

163
00:16:21,920 --> 00:16:23,169
If you ever recall something like that,

164
00:16:23,211 --> 00:16:24,211
let me know.

165
00:16:39,419 --> 00:16:40,419
Hey Balachander,

166
00:16:40,461 --> 00:16:42,544
I hear that corpses are
calling out your name.

167
00:16:42,836 --> 00:16:44,086
You're a bigshot now.

168
00:16:44,127 --> 00:16:44,878
Hey!

169
00:16:45,544 --> 00:16:46,878
Wash your mouth on the way out.

170
00:16:48,670 --> 00:16:49,711
Moron!

171
00:16:53,169 --> 00:16:56,127
Three years ago, there was a
case registered in that house.

172
00:16:58,378 --> 00:17:02,003
Last week, he was found sleeping in
an ATM in Anna nagar 11th main road.

173
00:17:02,044 --> 00:17:04,670
We brought him in for questioning

174
00:17:04,711 --> 00:17:06,711
and he claimed to have blacked out.

175
00:17:06,920 --> 00:17:08,711
Once we checked the surveillance cameras,

176
00:17:08,753 --> 00:17:09,795
we knew he was telling the truth.

177
00:17:11,878 --> 00:17:13,253
Did his mother come yet?

178
00:17:13,294 --> 00:17:14,169
No sir.

179
00:17:15,003 --> 00:17:16,211
Alright.
You may leave.

180
00:17:16,294 --> 00:17:17,336
Okay sir.

181
00:17:41,836 --> 00:17:42,711
Yes, tell me?

182
00:17:46,503 --> 00:17:48,169
No...No...No!
Tomorrow morning is too late,

183
00:17:48,211 --> 00:17:49,920
I need to see her today
and right now.

184
00:17:49,962 --> 00:17:52,127
Tell her it's urgent
I am on my way.

185
00:17:52,169 --> 00:17:54,544
Somehow get an appointment
to see her right away.

186
00:18:03,044 --> 00:18:03,962
Let's go.

187
00:18:08,253 --> 00:18:10,461
He had his first session
just a couple of days back.

188
00:18:10,503 --> 00:18:13,336
Can't believe something like
this happened, it's shocking.

189
00:18:14,586 --> 00:18:18,586
I agreed to see you only
because you said it's urgent.

190
00:18:19,044 --> 00:18:20,795
Tomorrow I have an early morning session,

191
00:18:21,003 --> 00:18:22,086
I need to sleep.

192
00:18:22,711 --> 00:18:24,461
I keep records of all my sessions,

193
00:18:24,503 --> 00:18:26,628
this guy's session is also here.

194
00:18:27,628 --> 00:18:28,628
Have a listen.

195
00:18:29,003 --> 00:18:30,169
It might be a bit strange.

196
00:18:30,586 --> 00:18:32,920
I'm not sure if it's
going to help you.

197
00:18:34,169 --> 00:18:35,670
He looks to be disturbed,

198
00:18:35,711 --> 00:18:38,503
there's a high possibility
he could hurt himself.

199
00:18:38,628 --> 00:18:39,628
But I'm not sure.

200
00:18:39,795 --> 00:18:41,753
Please call me tomorrow
if you need me,

201
00:18:42,127 --> 00:18:43,503
immediately, I'll come there.

202
00:18:43,544 --> 00:18:45,086
- I'll make a move now.
- Thank you.

203
00:18:53,294 --> 00:18:54,920
"My name is Vignesh,

204
00:18:55,461 --> 00:18:56,836
I am from Bangalore.

205
00:18:57,836 --> 00:18:58,795
I don't have a dad,

206
00:18:59,086 --> 00:19:00,086
it's just me and my mom.

207
00:19:01,044 --> 00:19:03,294
Hey, why don't you stay
at your uncle's place?

208
00:19:03,336 --> 00:19:04,253
Mom,

209
00:19:05,044 --> 00:19:07,003
why do you keep asking
the same question?

210
00:19:07,086 --> 00:19:08,670
I'm telling you,

211
00:19:08,711 --> 00:19:10,127
I will have a crazy work schedule.

212
00:19:10,294 --> 00:19:11,586
It won't work.

213
00:19:12,003 --> 00:19:13,670
It's for just 3 months,

214
00:19:14,003 --> 00:19:15,419
I'll rent out a place.

215
00:19:15,461 --> 00:19:17,544
Don't give lame excuses.

216
00:19:17,586 --> 00:19:19,127
You just want your space to smoke,
isn't it?

217
00:19:19,169 --> 00:19:19,920
Yes mom!

218
00:19:19,962 --> 00:19:20,920
I'll whack you!

219
00:19:20,962 --> 00:19:23,461
Mom!
Just kidding!

220
00:19:23,795 --> 00:19:25,336
Santhosh has picked
out a place already.

221
00:19:25,962 --> 00:19:27,461
I just need to pay
the security deposit

222
00:19:27,503 --> 00:19:28,920
and settle in.

223
00:19:29,086 --> 00:19:30,211
Alright!

224
00:19:33,211 --> 00:19:34,253
Hold still!

225
00:19:34,670 --> 00:19:37,253
Also, drop in and
see him when you can.

226
00:19:37,294 --> 00:19:38,878
He'll be expecting you

227
00:19:39,294 --> 00:19:40,711
- Alright?
- Sure Mom.

228
00:19:40,795 --> 00:19:42,586
I will, just for your sake.

229
00:19:52,003 --> 00:19:53,086
Bye, mom.

230
00:19:55,711 --> 00:19:56,670
Yeah right!

231
00:19:56,711 --> 00:19:57,711
As if you will do it!

232
00:19:58,169 --> 00:19:59,753
I don't need you to do anything!

233
00:19:59,920 --> 00:20:01,378
I'll come and find a house myself!

234
00:20:02,169 --> 00:20:03,127
Hang up now!

235
00:20:04,378 --> 00:20:05,962
What a jerk!

236
00:20:06,211 --> 00:20:08,211
Have no idea how I'm friends with him!

237
00:20:48,461 --> 00:20:49,461
Yeah, I'm here.

238
00:20:49,503 --> 00:20:50,795
I'm just walking in.

239
00:20:51,336 --> 00:20:53,211
I said I'm here,

240
00:20:53,253 --> 00:20:54,378
Hang up already!

241
00:21:06,336 --> 00:21:08,586
You can meet Mr.Ganesh tomorrow evening

242
00:21:08,628 --> 00:21:09,628
and start your work.

243
00:21:09,836 --> 00:21:10,711
Okay sir,

244
00:21:10,836 --> 00:21:11,962
Where are you put up now?

245
00:21:12,003 --> 00:21:13,503
Right now, at a hotel sir.

246
00:21:13,544 --> 00:21:14,795
I need to find a place.

247
00:21:15,003 --> 00:21:15,836
Hotel?

248
00:21:15,962 --> 00:21:17,461
I thought you already found a place.

249
00:21:17,753 --> 00:21:19,962
- Ahem, why do you bring it up sir.
- Yeah Right.

250
00:21:20,003 --> 00:21:21,127
We'll handle it, no issues.

251
00:21:21,169 --> 00:21:23,753
(Chuckles) But you didn't handle it,

252
00:21:24,670 --> 00:21:25,544
You didn't.

253
00:21:26,628 --> 00:21:28,211
It's a joke.
We have to laugh.

254
00:21:31,169 --> 00:21:34,544
We'll end with a laugh and
continue with our work sir.

255
00:21:34,878 --> 00:21:36,044
Come let's go.

256
00:21:36,086 --> 00:21:37,628
You don't have to
report to office everyday,

257
00:21:37,711 --> 00:21:39,086
you just need to be here
when the director is here.

258
00:21:39,127 --> 00:21:41,711
You can work from home, it's up to you.

259
00:21:41,920 --> 00:21:45,294
In that case sir, I plan to
go house hunting today.

260
00:21:45,628 --> 00:21:47,753
Shall I report in office tomorrow
when the director is here?

261
00:21:47,795 --> 00:21:49,962
Do you want me to ask
around for a place to rent?

262
00:21:50,003 --> 00:21:51,753
Oh, don't want to trouble you sir.

263
00:21:51,836 --> 00:21:53,544
If you know of some place,
you please let me know.

264
00:21:53,586 --> 00:21:54,753
Of course,

265
00:21:54,795 --> 00:21:57,753
won't it be better
if it's closer to office?

266
00:21:58,003 --> 00:22:00,086
Sir, he might find it difficult
to find a place all by himself,

267
00:22:00,127 --> 00:22:01,753
Shall I go along to assist him?

268
00:22:02,294 --> 00:22:03,419
Let him do it by himself,

269
00:22:03,503 --> 00:22:04,628
you mind your business.

270
00:22:06,419 --> 00:22:08,003
What?
Do you want his company?

271
00:22:08,044 --> 00:22:08,920
Oh no, sir,

272
00:22:09,044 --> 00:22:10,962
I am in this mess because of him.

273
00:22:11,044 --> 00:22:12,920
It's better I handle this myself.

274
00:22:13,628 --> 00:22:14,628
Good choice.

275
00:22:16,086 --> 00:22:17,920
Alright sir, I will also go work.

276
00:22:17,962 --> 00:22:19,211
Yeah right!

277
00:22:20,003 --> 00:22:21,419
I handle this myself.

278
00:22:25,461 --> 00:22:28,962
Non-vegetarian food is fine,
but strictly no beef.

279
00:22:29,378 --> 00:22:31,461
No smoking.
Do not hammer nails into the wall.

280
00:22:31,503 --> 00:22:33,253
You shouldn't bring girls to the house.

281
00:22:33,336 --> 00:22:35,795
You shouldn't use more than
two buckets of water.

282
00:22:35,836 --> 00:22:37,753
Are you unmarried?
You don't have a girlfriend, right?

283
00:22:37,836 --> 00:22:40,378
Where is your hometown?
Are you working in the film industry?

284
00:22:40,419 --> 00:22:41,294
No!

285
00:22:41,336 --> 00:22:42,962
Don't you work for an IT company?
Do you drink alcohol?

286
00:22:43,003 --> 00:22:44,795
We shouldn't rent the house to bachelors.

287
00:22:45,461 --> 00:22:46,962
You should pay the maintenance
charges separately.

288
00:22:47,003 --> 00:22:49,878
You should use only 2 buckets of water
Are you unmarried?

289
00:22:49,920 --> 00:22:51,920
You don't have a girlfriend, right?

290
00:22:52,211 --> 00:22:53,836
Don't you work for an IT company?

291
00:22:58,378 --> 00:23:00,003
It's so hard to make ends
meet with fuel prices going up.

292
00:23:00,044 --> 00:23:01,711
Better look for other options.

293
00:23:01,753 --> 00:23:02,628
Brother,

294
00:23:02,670 --> 00:23:03,378
brother?

295
00:23:03,419 --> 00:23:04,920
Do you know of any
houses for rent nearby?

296
00:23:04,962 --> 00:23:05,795
Which area?

297
00:23:05,836 --> 00:23:07,253
Somewhere here in Anna Nagar?

298
00:23:07,294 --> 00:23:09,211
Ramesh, why don't you take
sir to the house on 3rd street?

299
00:23:09,253 --> 00:23:10,586
- Sure brother.
- Come, get in, let's go.

300
00:23:15,836 --> 00:23:17,211
The house on the first floor!

301
00:23:22,003 --> 00:23:23,086
This is the house.

302
00:23:23,753 --> 00:23:25,127
I'll go take a look, please wait here.

303
00:23:25,169 --> 00:23:26,544
Sure, I'll wait.

304
00:24:07,044 --> 00:24:07,878
What do you need?

305
00:24:07,920 --> 00:24:10,544
Sir, I saw the 'To-let' board outside

306
00:24:10,628 --> 00:24:12,003
and came to enquire.

307
00:24:15,127 --> 00:24:16,336
Give me a minute.

308
00:24:24,086 --> 00:24:26,419
Here, go take a look
at the house upstairs.

309
00:24:26,461 --> 00:24:27,878
We'll discuss the details later.

310
00:24:28,461 --> 00:24:29,461
Sir,

311
00:24:29,878 --> 00:24:30,836
what's the rent like?

312
00:24:30,878 --> 00:24:31,962
You first go upstairs

313
00:24:32,003 --> 00:24:33,503
and take a look,

314
00:24:33,544 --> 00:24:36,920
if you are still interested,
we'll discuss the details later.

315
00:24:37,878 --> 00:24:38,795
Go

316
00:26:02,003 --> 00:26:02,836
(Clears throat)

317
00:26:04,336 --> 00:26:05,044
Sir.

318
00:26:06,253 --> 00:26:07,211
Help yourself.

319
00:26:07,586 --> 00:26:08,461
Thank you, sir.

320
00:26:08,503 --> 00:26:09,503
Go ahead.

321
00:26:24,962 --> 00:26:26,003
How is it?

322
00:26:26,336 --> 00:26:27,211
Super sir.

323
00:26:27,878 --> 00:26:28,836
It's very nice.

324
00:26:29,670 --> 00:26:30,795
Filter coffee, isn't it?

325
00:26:34,962 --> 00:26:36,836
I'm not talking about the coffee,

326
00:26:37,378 --> 00:26:38,795
I was asking about the house upstairs.

327
00:26:39,003 --> 00:26:40,253
How is it?

328
00:26:40,544 --> 00:26:41,419
Sir!

329
00:26:41,670 --> 00:26:43,628
The house looks classy.

330
00:26:43,920 --> 00:26:46,127
But I am not part of that class.

331
00:26:47,503 --> 00:26:48,503
I don't get you.

332
00:26:49,586 --> 00:26:50,461
Sir.

333
00:26:51,003 --> 00:26:52,920
Let me be candid.

334
00:26:53,253 --> 00:26:55,503
I am looking to stay only for 3 months.

335
00:26:55,586 --> 00:26:57,253
If I tell people this,

336
00:26:57,336 --> 00:26:59,169
they don't even let me in.

337
00:26:59,962 --> 00:27:02,336
That's why I didn't start with this,

338
00:27:02,461 --> 00:27:04,127
I thought of taking a look at the house,

339
00:27:04,586 --> 00:27:06,962
and if I like it,
then we can talk details.

340
00:27:07,670 --> 00:27:08,378
But,

341
00:27:08,878 --> 00:27:10,503
looking at the house,

342
00:27:10,795 --> 00:27:12,586
I don't know if I can afford to stay here.

343
00:27:13,628 --> 00:27:14,628
Thank you for the coffee.

344
00:27:14,920 --> 00:27:16,753
- I'll leave now.
- Just a moment,

345
00:27:20,086 --> 00:27:22,795
Are you okay if the rent is 3000/- Rupees?

346
00:27:23,628 --> 00:27:24,711
Huh?

347
00:27:25,336 --> 00:27:26,962
Is that 3 zeros or 4 zeros sir?

348
00:27:27,127 --> 00:27:29,836
There are only 3 zeros in a thousand.

349
00:27:32,169 --> 00:27:34,003
Just 3000/- Rupees for this house?

350
00:27:34,253 --> 00:27:38,419
Are you wondering why I would rent out

351
00:27:38,586 --> 00:27:39,920
such a large space for just 3000/- Rupees?

352
00:27:39,962 --> 00:27:40,711
Sir!

353
00:27:40,753 --> 00:27:42,169
I can't believe it sir!

354
00:27:43,211 --> 00:27:45,169
Since you were so candid with me,

355
00:27:45,211 --> 00:27:47,586
let me also be transparent.

356
00:27:48,294 --> 00:27:51,503
At first, there were
three tenants upstairs.

357
00:27:52,003 --> 00:27:53,336
For whatever reason,

358
00:27:53,378 --> 00:27:55,253
one of them killed the other two

359
00:27:55,461 --> 00:27:57,086
and immolated himself.

360
00:27:58,253 --> 00:27:59,878
Then after some time,

361
00:28:00,127 --> 00:28:02,127
two new tenants came to stay.

362
00:28:02,294 --> 00:28:03,419
They claimed that

363
00:28:03,670 --> 00:28:05,294
the three previous tenants were not dead

364
00:28:05,419 --> 00:28:07,670
and they are still living in the house.

365
00:28:07,878 --> 00:28:11,503
They vacated on the
same day without notice.

366
00:28:11,878 --> 00:28:14,294
This incident
spread through the town.

367
00:28:14,419 --> 00:28:17,294
The house was then
rumoured to be haunted.

368
00:28:17,962 --> 00:28:19,253
I've been trying

369
00:28:19,419 --> 00:28:20,878
to sell off this house

370
00:28:20,920 --> 00:28:23,378
and move back to my native place.

371
00:28:23,419 --> 00:28:26,253
But, I've had no luck all these years.

372
00:28:27,711 --> 00:28:28,461
Now,

373
00:28:28,711 --> 00:28:30,461
If you're able to stay here for 3 months

374
00:28:30,503 --> 00:28:32,253
without any incident,

375
00:28:32,670 --> 00:28:34,920
I'll be able to sell off the house.

376
00:28:35,461 --> 00:28:36,711
As far as I can tell,

377
00:28:36,795 --> 00:28:37,753
this house

378
00:28:37,795 --> 00:28:39,670
isn't haunted.

379
00:28:40,044 --> 00:28:41,003
Even so,

380
00:28:41,253 --> 00:28:43,878
I didn't want to hide from you

381
00:28:44,003 --> 00:28:46,795
what the neighbours
believe about this house.

382
00:28:47,586 --> 00:28:51,086
I don't need any security deposit.

383
00:28:51,920 --> 00:28:53,294
You can decide, it's up to you.

384
00:28:53,336 --> 00:28:55,253
Forget the three ghosts,

385
00:28:55,294 --> 00:28:57,211
If I can rent this house
for 3000/- Rupees,

386
00:28:57,253 --> 00:29:00,962
I can make my peace
with even thirty ghosts.

387
00:29:01,503 --> 00:29:04,169
I don't believe in the supernatural,

388
00:29:04,211 --> 00:29:05,920
I really like the house.

389
00:29:05,962 --> 00:29:07,419
I can move in tomorrow.

390
00:29:07,461 --> 00:29:08,461
Here's your security deposit.

391
00:29:08,503 --> 00:29:10,962
No need for it now,

392
00:29:11,127 --> 00:29:12,753
you can give it when you move in.

393
00:29:12,795 --> 00:29:15,127
I am already your tenant sir,
here you go.

394
00:29:15,503 --> 00:29:17,003
We'll meet tomorrow.

395
00:29:23,544 --> 00:29:24,962
Hello sir.
Oh, welcome!

396
00:29:28,211 --> 00:29:29,836
- Is that all your belongings?
- Yes sir, that's all.

397
00:29:30,294 --> 00:29:32,503
Alright,
very happy to have you here.

398
00:29:32,544 --> 00:29:34,044
Thank you sir!

399
00:29:34,086 --> 00:29:35,211
Oh by the way,

400
00:29:37,294 --> 00:29:38,711
Do you smoke?

401
00:29:38,753 --> 00:29:41,378
He smokes night and day.

402
00:29:44,003 --> 00:29:46,294
I was just asking!

403
00:29:46,753 --> 00:29:47,378
Also,

404
00:29:47,920 --> 00:29:49,086
Alcohol?

405
00:29:49,169 --> 00:29:50,753
Sir, we are really
conscious of our health.

406
00:29:50,795 --> 00:29:52,378
We strive to have a healthy lifestyle.

407
00:29:52,419 --> 00:29:53,003
Oh!

408
00:29:53,086 --> 00:29:54,670
We'll drink if someone sponsors.

409
00:29:54,753 --> 00:29:58,378
Ah, you and I are the one and same.

410
00:29:59,628 --> 00:30:00,378
Son,

411
00:30:00,711 --> 00:30:03,711
Don't worry, you can call me anytime.

412
00:30:03,753 --> 00:30:06,127
I'm always ready to pour one out.

413
00:30:06,253 --> 00:30:07,962
Alright sir.

414
00:30:08,003 --> 00:30:09,003
We'll take off now.

415
00:30:47,211 --> 00:30:48,586
Yeah mom, he's right here.

416
00:30:49,670 --> 00:30:50,795
The house is really nice.

417
00:30:51,211 --> 00:30:52,211
Yes, really.

418
00:30:52,461 --> 00:30:53,711
Okay, I'll call you tomorrow.

419
00:30:53,962 --> 00:30:55,461
Good night!
Bye mom.

420
00:30:58,127 --> 00:31:00,253
It's fun to drink with friends, right?

421
00:31:00,294 --> 00:31:01,294
Yeah yeah.

422
00:31:01,419 --> 00:31:02,169
Bro!

423
00:31:02,336 --> 00:31:04,294
If I have hard liquor,
I tend to get a bad hangover.

424
00:31:04,336 --> 00:31:05,419
Let me just have some beers.

425
00:31:05,586 --> 00:31:07,044
Sure buddy,
go ahead.

426
00:31:07,294 --> 00:31:08,461
Better you pay in cash.

427
00:31:08,503 --> 00:31:11,003
Now a days liquor shops
don't accept card payments.

428
00:31:13,628 --> 00:31:15,127
You're not gonna buy right?

429
00:31:16,211 --> 00:31:17,003
Right.

430
00:31:17,461 --> 00:31:19,920
I haven't even cleaned my own toilet.

431
00:31:19,962 --> 00:31:23,003
I thought you'd buy me a drink
and scrubbed your toilets clean.

432
00:31:23,044 --> 00:31:24,294
Very nice.

433
00:31:25,461 --> 00:31:26,753
I'll buy my own drinks.

434
00:31:26,795 --> 00:31:28,003
Sounds like a plan!

435
00:31:28,628 --> 00:31:30,127
- Good night!
- Just die!

436
00:31:31,378 --> 00:31:33,003
Don't turn up for my funeral.

437
00:32:15,836 --> 00:32:16,920
And now this...

438
00:32:48,753 --> 00:32:49,795
Excuse me?

439
00:32:51,461 --> 00:32:52,586
Is sir there?

440
00:32:53,003 --> 00:32:54,253
Please wait, I'll call him.

441
00:33:02,503 --> 00:33:03,253
Sir?

442
00:33:03,544 --> 00:33:04,294
Over here!

443
00:33:06,211 --> 00:33:08,436
Son, don't mind this.

444
00:33:08,461 --> 00:33:10,962
We have some electricity issues here.

445
00:33:11,086 --> 00:33:13,586
We'll have frequent, but
short power cuts like this.

446
00:33:13,920 --> 00:33:14,628
Alright!

447
00:33:14,711 --> 00:33:16,586
Do you have a candle or shall I ...

448
00:33:17,253 --> 00:33:19,878
Would you look at that,
the power is back on.

449
00:33:20,294 --> 00:33:21,336
Yes sir.

450
00:33:21,811 --> 00:33:24,061
- Did you have dinner?
- Not yet but I've already ordered.

451
00:33:24,086 --> 00:33:26,127
Why don't you come down
and have dinner here?

452
00:33:26,169 --> 00:33:27,169
No sir, thank you.

453
00:33:27,294 --> 00:33:28,127
Okay then, good night!

454
00:33:28,169 --> 00:33:29,211
Good night sir!

455
00:33:29,544 --> 00:33:32,003
(humming)

456
00:33:37,003 --> 00:33:38,711
I'll need a packet of milk everyday.

457
00:33:38,753 --> 00:33:39,836
Sure, will let the milkman know.

458
00:33:39,878 --> 00:33:41,294
He'll do it.

459
00:33:41,336 --> 00:33:42,962
Alright.
Thanks bro.

460
00:33:44,336 --> 00:33:46,336
Can you hand me the salt please?

461
00:33:46,920 --> 00:33:49,336
This story is a...

462
00:33:49,836 --> 00:33:51,169
Not any love story,

463
00:33:51,628 --> 00:33:53,836
it's a fierce and terrific
love story.

464
00:33:55,169 --> 00:33:56,628
This type of content

465
00:33:57,086 --> 00:33:58,878
has never been seen in Tamil

466
00:33:59,003 --> 00:34:00,253
No no, in Indian

467
00:34:00,294 --> 00:34:02,378
Sir, in global cinema!

468
00:34:03,753 --> 00:34:04,753
Right,

469
00:34:05,419 --> 00:34:06,836
it's never before seen in global cinema.

470
00:34:07,003 --> 00:34:08,253
Have you ever been in love?

471
00:34:08,586 --> 00:34:09,336
No

472
00:34:09,586 --> 00:34:11,544
Once this film hits the theaters,

473
00:34:12,211 --> 00:34:14,711
The younger generation
will all fall in love

474
00:34:14,795 --> 00:34:18,044
Left, right and centre.

475
00:34:18,419 --> 00:34:19,253
And...

476
00:34:19,461 --> 00:34:20,711
I'll condense...

477
00:34:20,920 --> 00:34:22,670
the story and narrate it in just 2 hours.

478
00:34:22,962 --> 00:34:24,586
Okay, just 2 hours.

479
00:34:24,628 --> 00:34:25,586
Hmm

480
00:34:25,628 --> 00:34:27,253
You go on sir.

481
00:34:28,670 --> 00:34:30,127
In the opening scene,

482
00:34:31,003 --> 00:34:33,378
there's a girl that falls
into a drain hole.

483
00:34:34,461 --> 00:34:35,503
Then

484
00:34:36,086 --> 00:34:39,086
from the drain hole, the hero emerges.

485
00:34:39,336 --> 00:34:41,211
The story is a snooze fest.

486
00:34:41,586 --> 00:34:44,169
The poster will be misleading.

487
00:34:44,586 --> 00:34:48,294
How did such a story
get a producer on board?

488
00:34:49,086 --> 00:34:50,086
What's the name of the movie?

489
00:34:50,503 --> 00:34:51,670
One girl

490
00:34:51,836 --> 00:34:52,878
and two guys.

491
00:34:53,169 --> 00:34:54,419
Dude, come on?

492
00:34:55,086 --> 00:34:56,711
I'm serious,

493
00:34:56,795 --> 00:34:58,294
it's a love triangle apparently.

494
00:34:58,336 --> 00:34:59,920
That sounds ridiculous.

495
00:34:59,962 --> 00:35:01,503
I know right!

496
00:35:02,294 --> 00:35:03,795
Whatever.

497
00:35:05,378 --> 00:35:06,294
Let that be,

498
00:35:06,461 --> 00:35:07,962
are we drinking tonight?

499
00:35:09,378 --> 00:35:10,586
I've just moved in,

500
00:35:10,628 --> 00:35:12,003
don't want complaints already.

501
00:35:12,253 --> 00:35:13,962
- You're just making excuses.
- Yep.

502
00:35:14,336 --> 00:35:15,211
I see.

503
00:35:54,586 --> 00:35:58,294
(Phone ringing)

504
00:36:05,753 --> 00:36:06,503
Hi mom!

505
00:36:07,962 --> 00:36:08,920
Yes, I ate.

506
00:36:10,711 --> 00:36:12,544
I'll meet Santhosh tomorrow,

507
00:36:12,670 --> 00:36:13,711
he went home.

508
00:36:16,711 --> 00:36:18,003
Did you take all your pills?

509
00:36:20,461 --> 00:36:21,294
Alright mom.

510
00:36:22,962 --> 00:36:23,836
Okay.

511
00:36:24,711 --> 00:36:26,586
Don't worry, I'll be fine.

512
00:38:17,836 --> 00:38:19,169
(Yawns)

513
00:38:20,003 --> 00:38:27,211
(Program on television)

514
00:38:33,670 --> 00:38:35,336
(Yawns)

515
00:39:14,753 --> 00:39:17,378
Sir, you're right,
I am the one who borrowed it.

516
00:39:17,836 --> 00:39:19,378
The minute I get some money,

517
00:39:19,419 --> 00:39:20,920
I will repay everything sir.

518
00:39:20,962 --> 00:39:22,628
When are you going to find a buyer,

519
00:39:22,670 --> 00:39:23,920
and when will you repay?

520
00:39:24,294 --> 00:39:25,628
I swear to God,

521
00:39:25,670 --> 00:39:27,503
I will definitely repay the loan.

522
00:39:27,586 --> 00:39:28,878
You say the same thing, every time.

523
00:39:28,920 --> 00:39:30,253
How much longer are you going to fool us
with the same line?

524
00:39:30,294 --> 00:39:32,503
I am not deceiving you.

525
00:39:32,544 --> 00:39:33,878
Alright, when are you
going to sell the house?

526
00:39:33,920 --> 00:39:35,753
I have buyers coming in soon.

527
00:39:35,795 --> 00:39:38,586
- When are you going to sell? When?!
- The buyers will come soon.

528
00:39:38,628 --> 00:39:40,127
No sane person will buy it.

529
00:39:49,003 --> 00:39:51,127
Here, load the programs on this drive.

530
00:39:54,003 --> 00:39:55,920
Your face is very annoying,
can't look at it.

531
00:39:56,336 --> 00:39:57,169
Oh.

532
00:39:57,211 --> 00:39:59,461
So I've decided to work from home.

533
00:40:52,169 --> 00:40:53,461
(Pan clatters)

534
00:41:24,253 --> 00:41:25,503
Not again!

535
00:41:28,211 --> 00:41:31,628
(Panting)

536
00:41:32,920 --> 00:41:33,878
Hey!

537
00:41:34,211 --> 00:41:35,461
Hey!

538
00:41:46,586 --> 00:41:52,419
(Popular Tamil song 'Apdi Podu' playing)

539
00:42:13,253 --> 00:42:17,544
(Breathing heavily)

540
00:42:30,294 --> 00:42:31,503
(Book thumps)

541
00:43:53,294 --> 00:43:55,003
Hey, you with the annoying face!

542
00:43:56,253 --> 00:43:57,962
You said you're working from home.

543
00:43:58,003 --> 00:43:59,253
You've landed up here the very next day.

544
00:43:59,294 --> 00:44:01,003
Go away!

545
00:44:02,336 --> 00:44:04,419
This is my office too,
I'll go when I want to.

546
00:44:04,461 --> 00:44:06,086
I said, go away!

547
00:44:11,294 --> 00:44:12,169
Moron!

548
00:44:43,836 --> 00:44:45,836
(Sudden gasp)

549
00:45:49,795 --> 00:45:52,003
(Coffee machine whirring)

550
00:47:52,294 --> 00:47:59,503
(Loud gasps)

551
00:49:13,795 --> 00:49:20,294
(Tamil song "Apdi Podu" playing)

552
00:50:19,003 --> 00:50:20,711
(Thumps TV)

553
00:51:33,795 --> 00:51:34,920
Dude, Just listen to me.

554
00:51:35,419 --> 00:51:37,253
Somehow finalise the deal please.

555
00:51:37,294 --> 00:51:38,753
I need to move out of here.

556
00:51:39,544 --> 00:51:40,836
Call me back once you confirm!

557
00:51:41,544 --> 00:51:42,378
Sir...

558
00:51:42,544 --> 00:51:43,544
Son,

559
00:51:44,086 --> 00:51:45,711
I was about to come find you,

560
00:51:45,753 --> 00:51:47,753
I have no words to express my gratitude.

561
00:51:48,461 --> 00:51:50,461
The minute you set foot in this house,

562
00:51:50,962 --> 00:51:52,711
all my woes ended,

563
00:51:53,003 --> 00:51:54,753
you've brought good fortune to me.

564
00:51:55,336 --> 00:51:57,962
A buyer has agreed to buy this house.

565
00:51:58,003 --> 00:51:59,753
All the details are finalised.

566
00:52:00,503 --> 00:52:01,253
Now on...

567
00:52:01,711 --> 00:52:03,670
I'll be able to repay all my debt.

568
00:52:03,711 --> 00:52:04,920
I'll go spend the last years of my life

569
00:52:05,169 --> 00:52:08,920
blissfully in my native town.

570
00:52:09,628 --> 00:52:11,711
You're the sole reason for this!

571
00:52:12,294 --> 00:52:15,086
I can't thank you enough.

572
00:52:15,628 --> 00:52:16,878
My son! Thank you!

573
00:52:16,920 --> 00:52:18,836
Thank you so much!

574
00:52:37,211 --> 00:52:39,711
Why do you look like a deflated balloon?

575
00:52:40,169 --> 00:52:42,253
You don't find my face annoying anymore?

576
00:52:42,294 --> 00:52:43,127
Dude,

577
00:52:43,169 --> 00:52:44,920
there's a lot of power cuts at home.

578
00:52:45,336 --> 00:52:47,169
That's why I'm here.

579
00:52:47,378 --> 00:52:49,003
Flawless logic!

580
00:52:49,294 --> 00:52:50,920
Could have just stayed put here.

581
00:52:51,586 --> 00:52:53,878
Oh by the way, the house you asked for,

582
00:52:53,920 --> 00:52:56,003
I've arranged a viewing tomorrow morning.

583
00:52:56,294 --> 00:52:57,795
No need for it!

584
00:52:57,962 --> 00:52:58,836
Let it be.

585
00:53:03,836 --> 00:53:05,586
One moment you're desperate for a house,
Next moment you're rejecting it.

586
00:53:05,628 --> 00:53:06,962
I said leave it.

587
00:53:12,586 --> 00:53:13,878
Is something wrong?

588
00:53:15,336 --> 00:53:16,503
Nothing like that.

589
00:53:16,920 --> 00:53:19,003
I'm feeling a bit unsettled in the house.

590
00:53:19,294 --> 00:53:20,503
But it's just for three months so

591
00:53:20,670 --> 00:53:22,378
I'll try and put up with it somehow.

592
00:53:22,920 --> 00:53:25,169
Explain to these people and
tell them we're not interested.

593
00:53:26,670 --> 00:53:27,294
(Sighs)

594
00:53:27,336 --> 00:53:28,670
Right, I'll handle it.

595
00:53:31,878 --> 00:53:33,294
- Do you want me to stay back?
- No, I'll be fine.

596
00:53:33,795 --> 00:53:35,003
Don't worry I'll take care.

597
00:53:36,086 --> 00:53:37,836
Okay, let me know once you go home.

598
00:53:37,962 --> 00:53:38,920
Okay bro.

599
00:53:47,962 --> 00:53:51,419
"Darkness is the shade of deathly fear!"

600
00:53:51,461 --> 00:53:54,544
"Only in the moment
the soul departs from here,"

601
00:53:54,795 --> 00:53:59,670
"Will the nights of endless
searching cease to be."

602
00:54:01,670 --> 00:54:04,962
"When the impossible comes to be,"

603
00:54:05,003 --> 00:54:08,378
"the truth masked as a lie,
that I cannot see"

604
00:54:08,419 --> 00:54:13,711
"Won't my eyes find
rest just for a night?"

605
00:54:15,378 --> 00:54:18,753
"Soaked in the richness of blood,"

606
00:54:18,795 --> 00:54:22,211
"Standing on the brink of death,"

607
00:54:22,253 --> 00:54:27,461
"Will those lips resist a smile?"

608
00:54:29,003 --> 00:54:32,544
"That which seemed not to be,"

609
00:54:32,586 --> 00:54:35,836
"Now when the illusions fade,"

610
00:54:35,962 --> 00:54:42,461
"will exist as they're meant to be."

611
00:54:43,419 --> 00:54:46,962
The investigation revealed that Jeeva...

612
00:54:47,003 --> 00:54:53,753
brutally stabbed his roommates,
Sathish and Mohan,

613
00:54:53,795 --> 00:54:59,753
...to death before setting himself
on fire and taking his own life.

614
00:55:08,378 --> 00:55:12,544
The police officers who rushed to the
spot informed the fire department.

615
00:55:12,670 --> 00:55:15,920
The fire department rushed to the
spot and extinguished the fire

616
00:55:16,003 --> 00:55:18,044
Meanwhile, the
Thagarakuppam police conducted

617
00:55:18,086 --> 00:55:20,503
...a detailed investigation
into the incident.

618
00:55:20,670 --> 00:55:25,211
The police confirmed that
he was Venugopal.

619
00:55:25,378 --> 00:55:28,003
The family members were notified.

620
00:55:28,044 --> 00:55:30,169
They arrived at the site of the incident

621
00:55:30,211 --> 00:55:33,586
and broke down seeing
the burnt body of Venugopal.

622
00:55:33,628 --> 00:55:36,253
Venugopal's son has given
a comment on this incident.

623
00:55:36,419 --> 00:55:38,169
He alleges this to be
a premeditated murder.

624
00:55:38,211 --> 00:55:39,753
He says that his father Venugopal had

625
00:55:39,795 --> 00:55:41,294
just wrapped up a
business deal in Puducherry.

626
00:55:41,336 --> 00:55:42,419
He was bringing back
money to Thagarakuppam.

627
00:55:42,461 --> 00:55:45,169
The son claims
Venugopal had asked...

628
00:55:45,211 --> 00:55:48,211
...the family to come pick
him up immediately.

629
00:55:48,336 --> 00:55:53,086
after seeing his father's burnt body.

630
00:55:53,127 --> 00:55:56,878
Further it was reported that the
ambulance did not arrive on time

631
00:55:56,920 --> 00:56:03,378
and hence the son was forced to take his
father's burnt body in his own vehicle.

632
00:56:03,419 --> 00:56:08,753
Police are also looking
at the angle of an ambush

633
00:56:16,586 --> 00:56:17,378
Hey!

634
00:56:18,169 --> 00:56:19,294
Who's there?

635
00:56:53,962 --> 00:56:55,294
Son, what's wrong?

636
00:56:55,336 --> 00:56:56,836
It's just me! I was eating!

637
00:57:02,795 --> 00:57:03,920
Go away!

638
00:57:40,044 --> 00:57:43,795
"My hollow days are shrinking,"

639
00:57:47,003 --> 00:57:50,878
"My haunted nights are long and winding."

640
00:57:53,711 --> 00:57:57,086
"Today, the voices inside my head,"

641
00:57:57,294 --> 00:58:00,544
"Create for me an eternal resting bed."

642
00:58:00,586 --> 00:58:05,836
"Burying my face and
turning me into dust."

643
00:58:07,503 --> 00:58:10,628
"Darkness is the shade of deathly fear!"

644
00:58:10,670 --> 00:58:13,920
"Only in the moment the
soul departs from here,"

645
00:58:14,211 --> 00:58:20,503
"Will the nights of endless
searching cease to be!"

646
00:58:21,127 --> 00:58:24,461
"When the impossible comes to be,"

647
00:58:24,503 --> 00:58:27,962
"the truth masked as a lie,
that I cannot see."

648
00:58:28,003 --> 00:58:34,962
"Won't my eyes find
rest just for a night?"

649
00:58:56,044 --> 00:58:57,169
At 6pm tomorrow,

650
00:58:57,211 --> 00:58:58,586
we've announced the movie poster release.

651
00:58:59,753 --> 00:59:02,795
When will you finalise the design
and when will you send it to me?

652
00:59:02,836 --> 00:59:03,544
Sir,

653
00:59:03,586 --> 00:59:05,169
I've already mailed it to you!

654
00:59:05,670 --> 00:59:07,544
Let's take a look.

655
00:59:19,962 --> 00:59:22,419
How am I supposed to make sense of this?

656
00:59:22,795 --> 00:59:23,920
Shall I take it this way?

657
00:59:24,586 --> 00:59:26,461
That is a terrifying love story?

658
00:59:26,920 --> 00:59:27,920
Where is the girl?

659
00:59:28,962 --> 00:59:30,253
There are three dudes here!

660
00:59:33,294 --> 00:59:34,503
What are you guys doing?

661
00:59:38,753 --> 00:59:39,586
Sir,

662
00:59:39,753 --> 00:59:41,503
we'll come up with a couple
of drafts by tonight.

663
00:59:41,586 --> 00:59:42,920
We'll get it done.

664
00:59:43,711 --> 00:59:45,378
I'll take the responsibility.

665
00:59:46,544 --> 00:59:47,670
Why are you loitering here?

666
00:59:48,670 --> 00:59:49,920
- Tell them I'll be there in 10 mins.
- Okay, sir.

667
00:59:51,628 --> 00:59:53,127
Move a bit towards me.

668
00:59:53,544 --> 00:59:55,253
Get a bit of this light!

669
00:59:55,294 --> 00:59:57,294
And a bit of that!

670
00:59:57,336 --> 00:59:58,586
This is your position.

671
00:59:59,878 --> 01:00:02,003
First take off your sunglasses.

672
01:00:02,544 --> 01:00:04,795
Just cause you were the
cinematographer for "DADA" movie,

673
01:00:04,836 --> 01:00:06,711
Doesn't make you Stephen Spielberg!

674
01:00:07,378 --> 01:00:08,753
Sir, just to check the lighting!

675
01:00:08,795 --> 01:00:11,503
Oh, to make sure I'm visible?

676
01:00:13,127 --> 01:00:13,878
Hey!

677
01:00:13,920 --> 01:00:16,419
Why don't you sit on my head?

678
01:00:16,586 --> 01:00:18,169
That's the comedic angle sir.

679
01:00:18,211 --> 01:00:20,211
Oh there's an angle for comedy?

680
01:00:20,378 --> 01:00:20,962
Yes sir!

681
01:00:21,003 --> 01:00:23,127
You're a genius I say!

682
01:00:23,169 --> 01:00:25,044
Alright sir, at least this
time, let's get the shot right.

683
01:00:25,086 --> 01:00:25,836
Sir!

684
01:00:25,920 --> 01:00:27,294
Yes, give me my lines.

685
01:00:27,378 --> 01:00:29,878
Sir, it's going to take 30 mins
for the shot to be prepped.

686
01:00:30,044 --> 01:00:31,795
You can chill in the caravan.

687
01:00:32,127 --> 01:00:33,962
I can chill the whole day too,

688
01:00:34,003 --> 01:00:34,920
but, one thing.

689
01:00:35,336 --> 01:00:37,211
At 5:55pm sharp,

690
01:00:37,253 --> 01:00:38,836
just like "Thalapathy's" 'BEAST'

691
01:00:38,878 --> 01:00:40,294
I'll be out of here.

692
01:00:40,336 --> 01:00:42,878
I am very prompt with it.

693
01:00:42,920 --> 01:00:43,920
There's a small issue sir,

694
01:00:43,962 --> 01:00:44,836
that's why.

695
01:00:44,878 --> 01:00:45,795
Issue?

696
01:00:45,836 --> 01:00:46,503
Yes sir.

697
01:00:46,544 --> 01:00:47,628
What's the issue?

698
01:00:47,753 --> 01:00:49,795
When asked for a romantic poster,

699
01:00:49,836 --> 01:00:51,586
they've designed a poster
for a horror movie.

700
01:00:51,628 --> 01:00:53,003
Oh my God!

701
01:00:53,294 --> 01:00:56,169
It's more or less the same.

702
01:00:56,211 --> 01:00:57,836
- Where's the director?
- Over there sir.

703
01:00:57,878 --> 01:00:58,878
Let's go see him.

704
01:00:59,003 --> 01:01:00,753
There's some issue with the director,

705
01:01:00,795 --> 01:01:02,086
I'm gonna check it out.

706
01:01:02,127 --> 01:01:03,419
The director is the issue sir.

707
01:01:04,503 --> 01:01:05,753
Hello director,

708
01:01:06,003 --> 01:01:08,127
what's the problem?

709
01:01:08,169 --> 01:01:09,795
Since you're a first time director,

710
01:01:09,836 --> 01:01:13,461
I moved my dates with
"Prabhas" to be here.

711
01:01:13,586 --> 01:01:15,836
Why are you stretching my time?

712
01:01:15,878 --> 01:01:17,670
Sir, they messed up the movie poster.

713
01:01:17,711 --> 01:01:19,127
- Huh, the poster?
- Show him!

714
01:01:19,753 --> 01:01:20,586
Show me!

715
01:01:20,753 --> 01:01:22,461
When asked for a romantic poster,

716
01:01:22,503 --> 01:01:23,962
they've designed a poster
for a horror movie.

717
01:01:24,461 --> 01:01:25,461
(Chuckles)

718
01:01:25,795 --> 01:01:28,003
Isn't he the one who designed this?

719
01:01:29,419 --> 01:01:30,544
How did you know that?

720
01:01:32,003 --> 01:01:33,378
Look at him!

721
01:01:34,670 --> 01:01:36,920
There's your problem.

722
01:01:36,962 --> 01:01:40,169
He's created a poster based on his psyche.

723
01:01:40,211 --> 01:01:41,962
This is a hit for sure!

724
01:01:42,086 --> 01:01:44,169
You get back to directing.
Focus on your scene.

725
01:01:44,211 --> 01:01:45,878
Don't get troubled by this.

726
01:01:45,920 --> 01:01:46,920
Please go.

727
01:01:48,753 --> 01:01:50,878
Brother, all the best!

728
01:01:51,169 --> 01:01:54,419
Be a good man and be a good citizen!

729
01:02:05,127 --> 01:02:06,628
Even the termite repellent.

730
01:02:06,670 --> 01:02:07,628
Yes sir.

731
01:02:07,670 --> 01:02:10,419
Make sure pesticides are sprayed
on all the furniture here.

732
01:02:10,461 --> 01:02:11,544
Okay sir, we'll take care.

733
01:02:12,044 --> 01:02:13,044
Hey Vignesh!

734
01:02:13,419 --> 01:02:14,586
Didn't you hear?

735
01:02:15,044 --> 01:02:16,419
There's office maintenance
work underway now.

736
01:02:16,461 --> 01:02:18,086
They are doing pest-control.

737
01:02:18,419 --> 01:02:19,544
Everyone's assigned to work from home.

738
01:02:19,586 --> 01:02:21,044
Sir, it's alright.

739
01:02:21,086 --> 01:02:23,169
I'll stay here in some corner.

740
01:02:23,211 --> 01:02:24,753
All the corners will be occupied.

741
01:02:24,795 --> 01:02:26,378
You can't be here,
you might inhale some fumes.

742
01:02:26,419 --> 01:02:27,670
Why don't you take it easy for now?

743
01:02:28,127 --> 01:02:30,127
You look exhausted,
rest for a couple of days.

744
01:02:30,586 --> 01:02:31,294
Okay?

745
01:02:31,336 --> 01:02:32,461
When you're drilling the walls,

746
01:02:32,503 --> 01:02:33,503
make sure the holes are not too big,

747
01:02:33,628 --> 01:02:34,503
they'll cause damage.

748
01:02:34,544 --> 01:02:35,795
Okay sir, don't worry we'll be mindful.

749
01:02:35,836 --> 01:02:37,211
Ensure the furniture is all done.

750
01:03:08,461 --> 01:03:09,711
This is the room sir.

751
01:03:10,503 --> 01:03:11,670
Take care!

752
01:04:42,962 --> 01:04:44,586
I'm Vignesh's mother,

753
01:04:44,836 --> 01:04:46,711
the upstairs house is locked.

754
01:04:47,003 --> 01:04:48,253
I tried to reach him,

755
01:04:48,294 --> 01:04:50,211
but I think he's busy at office.

756
01:04:50,253 --> 01:04:52,461
Oh no worries at all,
why don't you come in?

757
01:04:52,503 --> 01:04:54,294
I don't want to be a bother.

758
01:04:54,378 --> 01:04:56,127
Do you have a spare key I can use?

759
01:04:56,169 --> 01:04:58,003
- Yes, let me get it.
- Alright!

760
01:05:03,211 --> 01:05:04,044
Here you go.

761
01:05:04,711 --> 01:05:05,586
Okay.

762
01:05:06,920 --> 01:05:09,086
Do join us for breakfast tomorrow.

763
01:05:09,127 --> 01:05:10,127
Sure, I will.

764
01:05:44,753 --> 01:05:46,294
Look at all the dishes!

765
01:06:24,211 --> 01:06:28,211
(Tamil song playing in the background)

766
01:06:32,169 --> 01:06:33,169
Vicky!

767
01:06:41,003 --> 01:06:42,003
Vignesh!

768
01:06:45,753 --> 01:06:47,127
Are you home?

769
01:06:56,086 --> 01:06:57,419
(Sharp Gasp)

770
01:07:00,461 --> 01:07:01,836
(TV plays)

771
01:07:06,628 --> 01:07:08,127
(Book thumps)

772
01:07:24,169 --> 01:07:25,920
(Gasps)

773
01:07:31,586 --> 01:07:32,711
Mom!

774
01:07:34,086 --> 01:07:36,586
(Heavy panting)

775
01:07:56,962 --> 01:07:58,962
Open! Open!

776
01:07:59,253 --> 01:08:00,503
Come on! Open!

777
01:08:02,628 --> 01:08:03,461
Mom?!

778
01:08:09,753 --> 01:08:10,753
Mom?...

779
01:08:49,336 --> 01:08:50,503
Mom, where are you?

780
01:08:50,544 --> 01:08:52,253
Me? Where are you?

781
01:08:52,294 --> 01:08:53,711
I've been trying to reach you.

782
01:08:53,753 --> 01:08:55,795
Mom, if you're planning to visit me,
let me know first.

783
01:08:55,836 --> 01:08:57,169
- Don't drop in unannounced.
- Why?

784
01:08:57,211 --> 01:08:58,920
Are you up to some mischief?

785
01:08:58,962 --> 01:09:01,003
Nothing like that mom,
I'm just tensed because of work.

786
01:09:01,127 --> 01:09:02,127
Try to understand please.

787
01:09:02,169 --> 01:09:04,086
- I'll call you back later.
- Whatever.

788
01:09:04,127 --> 01:09:05,461
Is everything alright?

789
01:09:05,878 --> 01:09:07,336
Alright, you go to bed

790
01:09:18,253 --> 01:09:21,544
(TV plays)

791
01:09:50,628 --> 01:09:52,003
No, please stay.

792
01:09:52,127 --> 01:09:53,086
I was about to leave.

793
01:10:10,670 --> 01:10:11,795
Are you alright?

794
01:10:18,127 --> 01:10:19,127
I'm okay.

795
01:10:20,211 --> 01:10:21,211
Why do you ask?

796
01:10:22,836 --> 01:10:26,836
My dad would have definitely
spoken ill of me to you.

797
01:10:28,169 --> 01:10:29,419
You're his daughter?

798
01:10:31,711 --> 01:10:33,169
I thought he would have told you.

799
01:10:33,253 --> 01:10:35,920
That I'm solely responsible
for all his troubles.

800
01:10:37,878 --> 01:10:40,294
That's also why he stopped talking to me.

801
01:10:42,836 --> 01:10:44,086
Why are you responsible?

802
01:10:45,169 --> 01:10:46,044
What troubles?

803
01:10:47,670 --> 01:10:49,419
The guy who murdered the others?

804
01:10:50,378 --> 01:10:52,544
He professed his love for me that day.

805
01:10:54,836 --> 01:10:56,336
Once I rejected him,

806
01:10:57,544 --> 01:10:59,169
enraged, he went on to commit those acts.

807
01:10:59,920 --> 01:11:01,544
That's why dad's not able
to sell off the house

808
01:11:01,586 --> 01:11:02,962
and he's breaking his head over it.

809
01:11:05,336 --> 01:11:06,211
Thanks!

810
01:11:06,336 --> 01:11:07,211
What for?

811
01:11:07,962 --> 01:11:10,211
Because of you, he's a bit happy.

812
01:11:11,878 --> 01:11:15,378
You don't have to sacrifice
yourself to please anyone.

813
01:11:15,419 --> 01:11:16,253
That's alright.

814
