01:38:55,778 --> 01:38:59,945
To imagine him living a peaceful life
somewhere far away after cheating me

1088
01:39:00,236 --> 01:39:02,195
causes me unbearable pain, dad.

1089
01:39:03,153 --> 01:39:07,278
I assumed the baby in my
womb was our symbol of love.

1090
01:39:07,695 --> 01:39:10,153
But he turned it into
a symbol of betrayal.

1091
01:39:10,903 --> 01:39:13,612
I am unable to live
on with this pain, dad."

1092
01:39:40,654 --> 01:39:42,111
Balachander!

1093
01:39:47,153 --> 01:39:48,153
Who's there?

1094
01:39:49,070 --> 01:39:50,070
Who's there?

1095
01:40:00,195 --> 01:40:01,903
Did I not tell you to leave?!

1096
01:40:02,570 --> 01:40:04,487
Leave from here!

1097
01:40:08,278 --> 01:40:11,403
Leave! Leave from here Balachander!
Leave from here Balachander!

1098
01:40:14,362 --> 01:40:16,612
I asked Vignesh also to leave
from here but he did not listen.

1099
01:40:19,070 --> 01:40:21,570
I wanted to save Vignesh somehow,

1100
01:40:22,070 --> 01:40:25,487
but in the process of saving him,
I lost my dad.

1101
01:40:25,528 --> 01:40:26,778
"The older gentleman
suffered a heart attack

1102
01:40:26,819 --> 01:40:28,654
Time of death is approximately
8 hours ago"

1103
01:40:28,819 --> 01:40:33,403
The three tenants upstairs
are to blame for all this.

1104
01:40:36,612 --> 01:40:38,320
Eh! Why are you yelling?

1105
01:40:38,362 --> 01:40:41,320
Now that we did it, I'm cutting you loose.

1106
01:40:41,362 --> 01:40:42,612
What do you want now?

1107
01:40:43,153 --> 01:40:43,986
Hey,

1108
01:40:44,111 --> 01:40:45,654
he's shown his true colours.

1109
01:40:45,861 --> 01:40:47,861
Even eyed the house owner's daughter.

1110
01:40:47,903 --> 01:40:49,861
On top of that she's so curvy.

1111
01:40:49,903 --> 01:40:52,153
Dude! Don't worry, I'll handle her.

1112
01:40:52,195 --> 01:40:52,819
Hey!

1113
01:40:52,861 --> 01:40:53,903
What do you mean?

1114
01:40:53,945 --> 01:40:55,236
The landlord's daughter, obviously.

1115
01:40:55,278 --> 01:40:56,445
(Chuckles)

1116
01:40:56,861 --> 01:40:57,778
Bro...

1117
01:40:58,195 --> 01:41:00,570
You don't have to stick
yourself into everything.

1118
01:41:00,861 --> 01:41:03,070
Why can't we get a taste as well?

1119
01:41:09,153 --> 01:41:11,612
The moment I saw her, I made up my mind.

1120
01:41:11,945 --> 01:41:14,403
I'm going to be the first one on her.

1121
01:41:18,654 --> 01:41:20,528
Watch me charm her first.

1122
01:41:20,570 --> 01:41:23,528
Dude, I'm already working on it.

1123
01:41:27,819 --> 01:41:30,445
In a single month,
watch me get her in bed.

1124
01:41:30,778 --> 01:41:33,195
Bro, pay for the tea.

1125
01:41:39,362 --> 01:41:41,695
The way those three looked at me,

1126
01:41:41,945 --> 01:41:45,403
reminded me of the utter
betrayal and immense pain,

1127
01:41:45,445 --> 01:41:48,654
that Prabhu gave to me.

1128
01:41:54,362 --> 01:42:00,403
Their disgusting looks reignited
my extinguished wrath.

1129
01:42:00,528 --> 01:42:01,528
Actually....

1130
01:42:01,695 --> 01:42:03,320
I kinda like you.

1131
01:42:05,445 --> 01:42:10,195
One of them professed his
love but had ill intentions.

1132
01:42:12,236 --> 01:42:14,153
If you try to venture out alone,

1133
01:42:20,236 --> 01:42:22,986
Because of this, I was the one
who burnt them to death.

1134
01:42:24,711 --> 01:42:28,086
I'm warning you again.
Leave this place, Balachander.

